# Frontend Engineering Standards

## Component Architecture
- React 19 / Next.js App Router / Vue 3 Composition standards.
- Deep Design Thinking: Avoid purple-on-black AI slop templates. Use verified color tokens.
- Accessibility (WCAG AAA): Enforce semantic HTML tags, ARIA attributes, keyboard navigation, and high contrast.
- Performance: Memoize expensive computations; eliminate cascading re-renders.
- Reference Skills: Consult `./.agent/skills/frontend-design/SKILL.md` and `./.agent/skills/unslop/SKILL.md`.
